# Fire and Ice — a "Play Deck" folder deck installed by Duels of the Planeswalkers (1998): a ready-made
# player deck that shipped in the expansion's files but was not offered in-game (the precon
# page: "users would need to open the game's files and move them into a different directory").
# designer: Kevin Bane, Assistant Lead of Quality Assurance on Duels of the Planeswalkers (precon page, ref. 4)
# colours: U/R
# source: ../mage-go/data/preconstructed_decks.yaml shandalar.player_decks.kevin_bane ["Fire and
#   Ice"] [Tier 3 — mage-go's transcription of the expansion's Play Deck files]
# cross-check: https://mtg.wiki/page/Shandalar_Player_Decks_(Kevin_Bane) — "Fire and Ice"
#   [Tier-web — agrees card for card]
# cross-check: a screenshot of the original .DCK file is on the wiki page (files.mtg.wiki Fire_and_ice_duels.png)
# group: Kevin Bane's decks
name: Fire and Ice
